{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"上下文管理与滑动窗口策略\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 系统的上下文管理面临哪些挑战？请从窗口分配、记忆分层、压缩策略、上下文编排四个层面系统性地阐述解决方案，以及窗口溢出时的降级策略。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>上下文管理的挑战</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的上下文不只是\"对话历史\"，一次典型的 Agent 调用，上下文包含六七种不同类型的内容：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">[System Prompt]          固定开销，200-1000 token\n[工具定义]               每个工具 100-500 token\n[对话历史]               逐轮增长，每轮 200-1000 token\n[RAG 检索文档]           每次检索 500-3000 token\n[工具返回结果]           每次调用 100-5000 token\n[中间推理步骤]           每步 100-500 token\n[用户当前输入]            50-500 token\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>四层管理策略</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第一层：窗口分配（Quota Management）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">给上下文的每一部分设定配额，而不是随意增长：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ContextBudget</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"上下文预算管理\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> total_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">128000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>budget <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"system_prompt\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.015</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># ~2K</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_definitions\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.04</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token comment\"># ~5K</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"dialogue_history\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.25</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token comment\"># ~32K</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"rag_documents\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.31</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># ~40K</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_results\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.25</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># ~32K</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"input_reasoning\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.136</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># ~17K</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">allocate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> category<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"按配额分配空间，超出部分截断\"\"\"</span>\n        max_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>budget<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>category<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        actual_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> actual_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> content\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 需要截断或压缩</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_truncate_or_compress<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_truncate_or_compress</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 优先尝试智能压缩，不行再截断</span>\n        compressed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_smart_compress<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>compressed<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> compressed\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_hard_truncate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第二层：记忆分层（Memory Hierarchy）</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">工作记忆（热） → 短期记忆（温） → 中期摘要（凉） → 长期向量存储（冷）\n   ↑                                                  ↓\n   └────────────── 按需检索加载 ──────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>工作记忆</strong>：当前步骤必需的变量和状态（始终保留）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>短期记忆</strong>：最近 N 轮完整对话（滑动窗口）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>中期摘要</strong>：会话级摘要（压缩后保留）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>长期记忆</strong>：向量数据库，按需检索加载</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第三层：压缩策略（Compression）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ContextCompressor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"上下文压缩器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">compress_dialogue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> budget<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"对话历史压缩\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> budget<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 保留最近 N 轮完整对话</span>\n        recent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 保留最近5轮</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 更早的对话生成摘要</span>\n        older <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>older<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>budget<span class=\"token operator\">//</span><span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"[历史摘要] </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\n\\n[最近对话] </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">'\\n'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>recent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">compress_tool_result</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> budget<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具返回结果压缩\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> budget<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 保留关键字段，截断详细内容</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">isinstance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> v <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> k<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 长文本用摘要</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>budget<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">compress_rag_docs</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> budget<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"RAG 文档压缩\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 先 Rerank，只保留 Top-3 最相关文档</span>\n        reranked <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reranker<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rerank<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 每篇文档摘要</span>\n        summaries <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> doc <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> reranked<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> budget <span class=\"token operator\">//</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>budget<span class=\"token operator\">//</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第四层：上下文编排（Context Orchestration）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">控制多步推理中上下文的膨胀：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ContextOrchestrator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"上下文编排器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>transient_tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"get_current_time\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"calculate\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 阅后即焚</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>persistent_tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"search_knowledge_base\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"query_user_profile\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">should_preserve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"判断工具结果是否应该保留在上下文中\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>transient_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 瞬态信息，阅后即焚</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>persistent_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 持久信息，保留</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 根据结果长度和重要性判断</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">500</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 短结果保留，长结果摘要</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">preserve_reasoning_step</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> obs<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"保留推理步骤的摘要而非完整内容\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Step: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>thought<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> → </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> → </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>obs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>窗口溢出时的降级策略</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">OverflowHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"窗口溢出处理器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle_overflow</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Context<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> usage_ratio<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        usage_ratio: 当前使用量 / 总容量\n        策略按优先级顺序执行\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> usage_ratio <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> context  <span class=\"token comment\"># 正常</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Level 1: 预警，开始准备</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> usage_ratio <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.9</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_compress_rag_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 先压缩 RAG 文档</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Level 2: 主动压缩</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.9</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> usage_ratio <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.95</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_compress_rag_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_summarize_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 摘要历史</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_prune_tool_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 裁剪工具结果</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Level 3: 激进降级</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.95</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> usage_ratio <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_compress_rag_docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_summarize_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_prune_tool_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_reduce_system_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 简化系统提示</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_drop_older_memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 丢弃旧记忆</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># Level 4: 紧急处理</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_emergency_truncation<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 紧急截断</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"overflow\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Context window exceeded\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> context\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_emergency_truncation</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Context<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"紧急截断：保留最关键的信息\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 优先级：系统提示 &gt; 用户输入 &gt; 最近1轮对话 &gt; 其他</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Context<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            system<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>system<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            user_input<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            history<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>history <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            rag_docs<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：不同场景的配额应该怎么分配？答：知识库问答场景 RAG 配额大；工具调用密集场景工具返回配额大；长对话场景对话历史配额大。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：\"阅后即焚\"怎么判断？答：根据工具类型标记——查询当前时间、临时计算等结果是瞬态的；查询用户资料、知识库结果是持久的。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：溢出的监控指标有哪些？答：上下文使用率、溢出频率、信息丢失率、压缩次数等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：只靠滑动窗口管理上下文。实际上需要四层策略配合。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：所有场景用同一套配额。不同场景的上下文组成差异很大。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：溢出时才处理。实际上应该在达到 80% 时就开始预警和压缩。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}